  "title": "Lumipulse® pTau-217/Beta Amyloid 42 Ratio: Reactivation Summary",
  "summary": "The Lumipulse® pTau-217/Beta Amyloid 42 Ratio is an in vitro diagnostic (IVD) assay intended to support the identification of amyloid pathology associated with Alzheimer’s disease. Following a manufacturer-identified reagent issue in December 2025, the assay was temporarily withdrawn from clinical use.",
